PRIVACY POLICY
Bubble Popper Blast
Effective Date: June 4, 2026
Last Updated: June 4, 2026

================================================================

OVERVIEW

Bubble Popper Blast is a standalone Apple Watch game developed
by Emeraldys (com.emeraldys.BubblePopper.watchkitapp).

Bubble Popper Blast does not collect, store, or transmit any
personal data. Your privacy is fully protected by design.

================================================================

1. NO DATA COLLECTION

The App does not collect any information about you or your
device. Specifically, we do not collect:

- Personal identifiers (name, email, Apple ID, or device ID)
- Location data
- Health or fitness data
- Usage analytics or gameplay statistics
- Crash reports or diagnostic data
- Any information from your Apple Watch sensors

================================================================

2. ON-DEVICE STORAGE ONLY

The App stores one piece of data locally on your Apple Watch
using Apple's UserDefaults system: your personal best survival
time (high score).

This data never leaves your device. It is not transmitted to
any server, not shared with any third party, and not accessible
to us or anyone else. It exists solely on your watch to display
your record on the home screen.

You can clear this data at any time by uninstalling the App
from your Apple Watch.

================================================================

3. NO INTERNET CONNECTION REQUIRED

Bubble Popper Blast is a fully offline app. It does not make
any network requests, connect to any server, or communicate
over the internet at any time.

================================================================

4. NO THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

The App does not integrate any third-party SDKs, analytics
platforms, advertising networks, crash reporting tools, or
social login services. There are no third parties involved in
the operation of this App whatsoever.

================================================================

5. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY

Bubble Popper Blast is rated 4+ and is suitable for all ages.
Because the App does not collect any data from any user, there
is no risk of collecting personal information from children
under 13 (COPPA) or under 16 (GDPR).

================================================================

6. APPLE PLATFORM PRIVACY

The App is distributed through the Apple App Store and is
subject to Apple's standard platform privacy practices. Apple
may collect certain diagnostic or purchase data as part of its
standard App Store operations, governed by Apple's Privacy
Policy at https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/

This is independent of and separate from this App.

================================================================

7. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY

If we ever update this Privacy Policy, the new version will be
posted at the same URL with an updated effective date. Since
the App collects no data, any future changes would only occur
if new features are added that change this data posture.

================================================================

8. CONTACT US

If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy
or the App, please contact us at:

Emeraldys
Email: emeraldys.contact@gmail.com

